{"games":[{"id":90385411820316,"name":"[UPDATE!] Survive a Plate","desc":"THE SPOOKY SEASON IS HERE!\n\nSurvive a Plate is a fast paced plate/minigame game. Try to survive multiple events with up to 16 players! Purchase or craft unique blocks to build a fortified base to survive longer.\n\n💾 All data saves automaticly! 💾\n🎲 55+ blocks to place or use! 🎲\n⚡ 80+ unique events to survive! ⚡\n\nTags: Plate, Survive a Plate, House, Survive, fate, Plate game, Minigame, Horrific","path":"/game/90385411820316-survive-a-plate","slug":"90385411820316-survive-a-plate","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3e2691d608a2202523f451e252542e382a2d8c7778119d88fafd8e4dbf2602ae.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ba66b58304a319734d97a6a8edc0afe6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":4943522,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-25T17:49:21.379Z","creator":{"name":"CES Development","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":119263339969430,"name":"[Nyotalia] Steal A Hetalia","desc":"Steal Countries from everyone else! \nOr get your own, and protect them from being stolen.\n\nHow to play:\n🌎 1. Get countries that appear in the line. \n💸 2. Earn money to get even more characters.\n🕵️ 3. Steal from other players.\n🔥 4. Rebirth to increase your earnings.\n🔧5. Buy gears to troll other users!\n\n⚠️ Small avatars are punishable.\n\n⚠️ Since the game receives updates there will be a few bugs; any bugs should be reported in the Discord!\n\n⚠️ And for any bugs that have directly affected you please make a ticket in the Discord.","path":"/game/119263339969430-steal-a-hetalia","slug":"119263339969430-steal-a-hetalia","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b5add3e26743ca0e4e4b766e9533c82af405ceb3cbc3eec68f94aa6cb3d1fa64.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-24a3f7463ef99df3ed1ef63423f10565/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":3455184,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-05T03:20:06.290Z","creat